    "title": "Pre-Congress Workshops",
    "subtitle": "40th Annual Congress of Ophthalmology 2019",
    "summary": "International speakers and participants from across Pakistan attended this, the 40th \"KarOphth\" Congress, with preceeding workshops on Neuro-Ophthalmic Emergencies, Fundoscopy Simulation, Refractive Surgery with simulator, and with wet-lab.",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "3c721fe8cf5d51f5",
